      "description": "Comfy 101 Module 4 segmentation - matte extraction. Generates a multi-element landscape (cabin, mountains, pine forest, sky), then runs SAM3 Text Segmentation once per named part and outputs each as its own black/white matte via MaskToImage (matte_cabin, matte_mountains, matte_sky, matte_trees) - like pulling separate ID/roto mattes for compositing. No inpainting. Add more SAM3 nodes for more parts; raise max_detections to catch multiple instances. RealVisXL SDXL.",
